OL,3,GNEWSAConsultation launched on alcohol
OL,4,Alicensing fees
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey residents have been asked to
OL,7,Ftake part in a consultation about
OL,8,Falcohol licensing fees.
OL,10,FThe island's government said people
OL,11,Fcould share their views ahead of the
OL,12,FAlcohol Licensing (Jersey) Law 2026
OL,13,Ftaking effect in 2027. States Members
OL,14,Fapproved the new law in March.
OL,16,FIt will replace the existing system
OL,17,Fwith three principal licence categories
OL,18,Fincluding on-licences for alcohol sold
OL,19,Fand consumed on the premises,
OL,20,Foff-licences for alcohol sold to be
OL,21,Fconsumed elsewhere and event licences.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
