OL,3,GNEWSAConsultation launched on alcohol
OL,4,Alicensing fees
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said the introduction of
OL,7,Fthe new categories meant the existing
OL,8,Ffee structure would be replaced and it
OL,9,Fasked people to complete the
OL,10,Fconsultation on changes by 6 November.
